@host = https://localhost:7043
### Register a participant
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Test","lastName":"Runner","email":"runner@example.com","password":"Runner123!","role":"Participant"}
### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"runner@example.com","password":"Runner123!"}
### List events
GET {{host}}/api/events
